[en.CHARACTER_FEATHER_BANGS_NAME]
Feather Bangs

[en.CHARACTER_FEATHER_BANGS_DESC]
Feather Bangs was originally an ordinary pony, good at singing, and once pursued Sugar Belle, who was also a resident of Equal Town. After the establishment of the Resistance, Feather Bangs accidentally distracted the border patrol ponies in an attack by an Imperial border patrol team with his sound speakers, and eventually repelled the border patrol ponies who threatened the townspeople. With the recommendation of Double Diamond, he joined the Army Department.

In 1002, a joint command meeting pointed out that the coastal areas of the Resistance were blocked by Manehattan and were vulnerable to landing attacks. Therefore, Feather Bangs was appointed as the Acting Head of Navy, while retaining his original position in the Army Department, although he himself knew almost nothing about the Navy.

[zh.CHARACTER_FEATHER_BANGS_NAME]
羽波

[zh.CHARACTER_FEATHER_BANGS_DESC]
羽波原是一只普通的小马，擅长唱歌，曾经追求同为平等镇居民的糖蓓儿。在抵抗军建立后，羽波偶然在一次帝国边境巡逻队的袭击中用音响分心了边巡队小马，并最终击退了威胁镇民的边巡队小马，以此由双钻引荐，加入了陆军部。

在1002年，一次联合指挥部会议指出抵抗军沿海地区受到马哈顿的封锁，易受登陆袭击，于是羽波受命兼任代理海军部长，同时保留在陆军部的原职位，尽管他自己几乎对海军一窍不通。
